# 统一换行符为 LF
#
# 背景：容器内执行 backend/scripts/docker-entrypoint.sh 时，shebang 是
# "#!/bin/sh\r"（CRLF）会报 "No such file or directory" 并以 127 退出。
# Windows 上 core.autocrlf=true 会在 checkout 时把文本转成 CRLF，
# 若直接 docker build 就会把这个 CRLF 带进镜像。
# 这里显式钉死 LF，任何人任何机器 clone 下来都是可执行的行尾。

* text=auto eol=lf

*.sh    text eol=lf
*.py    text eol=lf
*.conf  text eol=lf
*.inc   text eol=lf
Dockerfile      text eol=lf
*.dockerfile    text eol=lf

# 二进制：禁止行尾转换与文本 diff
*.png    binary
*.jpg    binary
*.jpeg   binary
*.webp   binary
*.gif    binary
*.ico    binary
*.icns   binary
*.woff   binary
*.woff2  binary
*.ttf    binary
*.otf    binary
*.db     binary
*.zip    binary
*.gz     binary
*.tar    binary
